  "details": "I appreciate the new animations for indicators, but as someone who has the 'lock expressions' feature bound to one button to allow for better control of my facial expressions having my headset beep and spawn a huge banner pop up at the bottom of my screen every time I toggle is much more distracting than a simple icon next to the mic. \nEnjoying a lot of the new interface and so far this has been the biggest issue I've come across.",
